{"id":"pemrograman/css/bootstrap/07.-navigasi-dan-header","title":"07. Navigasi dan Header","slug":"07. navigasi dan header","relativePath":"Pemrograman/CSS/Bootstrap/07. Navigasi dan Header.md","folder":"Pemrograman/CSS/Bootstrap","frontmatter":{"tags":[],"aliases":[]},"tags":["programming"],"aliases":[],"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"1. Anatomi Lengkap Navbar Responsif","id":"1-anatomi-lengkap-navbar-responsif"},{"depth":3,"text":"Kunci Sukses Navbar:","id":"kunci-sukses-navbar"},{"depth":2,"text":"2. Navigasi Tab Interaktif (*Nav Tabs*)","id":"2-navigasi-tab-interaktif-nav-tabs"},{"depth":2,"text":"3. Penomoran Halaman (Pagination)","id":"3-penomoran-halaman-pagination"}],"content":"#programming \n\nHeader navigasi (*navbar*) adalah elemen pertama yang dilihat oleh pengunjung website. Bootstrap menyediakan komponen navigasi responsif yang otomatis berubah menjadi menu hamburger di layar ponsel dan berjejer rapi di layar komputer.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Anatomi Lengkap Navbar Responsif\n\nSebuah navbar Bootstrap standar terdiri dari:\n1. Pembungkus navbar: `.navbar .navbar-expand-lg`.\n2. Logo / Merek: `.navbar-brand`.\n3. Tombol Hamburger: `.navbar-toggler`.\n4. Konten Lipat: `.collapse .navbar-collapse`.\n5. Daftar Tautan: `.navbar-nav .nav-link`.\n\n```html\n<nav class=\"navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark sticky-top py-3 shadow-sm\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <!-- Brand Logo -->\n    <a class=\"navbar-brand fw-bold text-primary\" href=\"#\">NexusCorp</a>\n\n    <!-- Tombol Hamburger (Otomatis Muncul di Layar Ponsel) -->\n    <button class=\"navbar-toggler\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#navMenu\">\n      <span class=\"navbar-toggler-icon\"></span>\n    </button>\n\n    <!-- Menu Lipat -->\n    <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse\" id=\"navMenu\">\n      <!-- ms-auto Mendorong Tautan ke Sisi Kanan Navbar -->\n      <ul class=\"navbar-nav ms-auto mb-2 mb-lg-0 gap-lg-3\">\n        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link active\" href=\"#\">Beranda</a></li>\n        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#\">Layanan</a></li>\n        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#\">Harga</a></li>\n        <li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#\">Kontak</a></li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"ms-lg-3\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm rounded-pill px-3\">Daftar</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n```\n\n### Kunci Sukses Navbar:\n* **`navbar-expand-lg`** : Menentukan kapan menu hamburger melebar menjadi baris mendatar (pada layar ukuran `lg` / >= 992px). Jika Anda ingin menu melebar lebih awal di layar tablet, ganti menjadi `navbar-expand-md`.\n* **`sticky-top`** : Menjaga agar navbar tetap menempel di bagian paling atas layar saat halaman di-scroll ke bawah.\n* **`ms-auto`** : Memberikan margin start (kiri) otomatis sehingga link navigasi terdorong rapi ke sisi kanan layar.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Navigasi Tab Interaktif (*Nav Tabs*)\n\nMemungkinkan pengguna berpindah-pindah panel konten tanpa memuat ulang (*reload*) halaman:\n\n```html\n<!-- Tombol Tab Navigasi -->\n<ul class=\"nav nav-pills mb-3\" id=\"pills-tab\" role=\"tablist\">\n  <li class=\"nav-item\">\n    <button class=\"nav-link active\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#tab1\">Profil</button>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"nav-item\">\n    <button class=\"nav-link\" data-bs-toggle=\"pill\" data-bs-target=\"#tab2\">Keamanan</button>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<!-- Wadah Konten Tab -->\n<div class=\"tab-content\">\n  <div class=\"tab-pane fade show active p-3 bg-white border rounded\" id=\"tab1\">\n    Konten pengaturan profil pengguna.\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"tab-pane fade p-3 bg-white border rounded\" id=\"tab2\">\n    Konten pengaturan ganti password dan otentikasi 2FA.\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. Penomoran Halaman (Pagination)\n\nDigunakan di bagian bawah tabel data atau daftar katalog produk:\n\n```html\n<nav aria-label=\"Navigasi Halaman\">\n  <ul class=\"pagination pagination-sm justify-content-center\">\n    <li class=\"page-item disabled\"><a class=\"page-link\" href=\"#\">Sebelumnya</a></li>\n    <li class=\"page-item active\"><a class=\"page-link\" href=\"#\">1</a></li>\n    <li class=\"page-item\"><a class=\"page-link\" href=\"#\">2</a></li>\n    <li class=\"page-item\"><a class=\"page-link\" href=\"#\">3</a></li>\n    <li class=\"page-item\"><a class=\"page-link\" href=\"#\">Selanjutnya</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</nav>\n```\n* `justify-content-center` : Menengahkan posisi pagination di layar.\n* `pagination-sm` / `pagination-lg` : Mengatur ukuran bar navigasi.\n","excerpt":"#programming","readingTime":2,"updated":null,"contentHash":"sha256:fd8b959b8f58d7b5d68ad26fa311f5d83431dc8833976c389f31c070ccf5b4cb","outputPath":"Pemrograman/CSS/Bootstrap/07. Navigasi dan Header","breadcrumb":["Pemrograman","CSS","Bootstrap"],"links":[],"backlinks":[{"id":"pemrograman/css/bootstrap/03_bootstrap","title":"03_Bootstrap"}],"brokenLinks":[],"html":"<p>Header navigasi (<em>navbar</em>) adalah elemen pertama yang dilihat oleh pengunjung website. Bootstrap menyediakan komponen navigasi responsif yang otomatis berubah menjadi menu hamburger di layar ponsel dan berjejer rapi di layar komputer.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"1-anatomi-lengkap-navbar-responsif\">1. Anatomi Lengkap Navbar Responsif</h2>\n<p>Sebuah navbar Bootstrap standar terdiri dari:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Pembungkus navbar: <code>.navbar .navbar-expand-lg</code>.</li>\n<li>Logo / Merek: <code>.navbar-brand</code>.</li>\n<li>Tombol Hamburger: <code>.navbar-toggler</code>.</li>\n<li>Konten Lipat: <code>.collapse .navbar-collapse</code>.</li>\n<li>Daftar Tautan: <code>.navbar-nav .nav-link</code>.</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">nav</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark sticky-top py-3 shadow-sm\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"container\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Brand Logo --></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-brand fw-bold text-primary\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#\"</span>></span>NexusCorp<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Tombol Hamburger (Otomatis Muncul di Layar Ponsel) --></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-toggler\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"button\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-bs-toggle</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"collapse\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-bs-target</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#navMenu\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-toggler-icon\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>></span>\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Menu Lipat --></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"collapse navbar-collapse\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navMenu\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- ms-auto Mendorong Tautan ke Sisi Kanan Navbar --></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">ul</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-nav ms-auto mb-2 mb-lg-0 gap-lg-3\"</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nav-item\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nav-link active\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#\"</span>></span>Beranda<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nav-item\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nav-link\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#\"</span>></span>Layanan<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nav-item\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nav-link\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#\"</span>></span>Harga<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nav-item\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nav-link\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#\"</span>></span>Kontak<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">ul</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ms-lg-3\"</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"btn btn-primary btn-sm rounded-pill px-3\"</span>></span>Daftar<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">nav</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"kunci-sukses-navbar\">Kunci Sukses Navbar:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>navbar-expand-lg</code></strong> : Menentukan kapan menu hamburger melebar menjadi baris mendatar (pada layar ukuran <code>lg</code> / >= 992px). Jika Anda ingin menu melebar lebih awal di layar tablet, ganti menjadi <code>navbar-expand-md</code>.</li>\n<li><strong><code>sticky-top</code></strong> : Menjaga agar navbar tetap menempel di bagian paling atas layar saat halaman di-scroll ke bawah.</li>\n<li><strong><code>ms-auto</code></strong> : Memberikan margin start (kiri) otomatis sehingga link navigasi terdorong rapi ke sisi kanan layar.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"2-navigasi-tab-interaktif-nav-tabs\">2. Navigasi Tab Interaktif (<em>Nav Tabs</em>)</h2>\n<p>Memungkinkan pengguna berpindah-pindah panel konten tanpa memuat ulang (<em>reload</em>) halaman:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Tombol Tab Navigasi --></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">ul</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nav nav-pills mb-3\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"pills-tab\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"tablist\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nav-item\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nav-link active\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-bs-toggle</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"pill\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-bs-target</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#tab1\"</span>></span>Profil<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nav-item\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nav-link\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-bs-toggle</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"pill\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-bs-target</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#tab2\"</span>></span>Keamanan<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">ul</span>></span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Wadah Konten Tab --></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"tab-content\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"tab-pane fade show active p-3 bg-white border rounded\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"tab1\"</span>></span>\n    Konten pengaturan profil pengguna.\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"tab-pane fade p-3 bg-white border rounded\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"tab2\"</span>></span>\n    Konten pengaturan ganti password dan otentikasi 2FA.\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"3-penomoran-halaman-pagination\">3. Penomoran Halaman (Pagination)</h2>\n<p>Digunakan di bagian bawah tabel data atau daftar katalog produk:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">nav</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-label</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Navigasi Halaman\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">ul</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"pagination pagination-sm justify-content-center\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"page-item disabled\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"page-link\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#\"</span>></span>Sebelumnya<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"page-item active\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"page-link\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#\"</span>></span>1<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"page-item\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"page-link\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#\"</span>></span>2<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"page-item\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"page-link\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#\"</span>></span>3<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"page-item\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"page-link\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#\"</span>></span>Selanjutnya<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">ul</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">nav</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<ul>\n<li><code>justify-content-center</code> : Menengahkan posisi pagination di layar.</li>\n<li><code>pagination-sm</code> / <code>pagination-lg</code> : Mengatur ukuran bar navigasi.</li>\n</ul>","previous":"pemrograman/css/bootstrap/06.-formulir-dan-validasi","next":"pemrograman/css/bootstrap/08.-komponen-interaktif-(modals,-offcanvas,-dan-tooltips)"}